{"version":1,"key":"card:299","content":{"id":299,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7eac602b-8e09-42c8-b7f4-5166dbdbf36b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"async"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"color":"inherit","text":"await"},{"type":"formatted","color":"inherit","text":"，以同步的方式写"},{"type":"formatted","text":"异步的代码。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"838b7465-5762-4523-a27f-633cc88bbd75","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 编写的异步代码已经与同步代码很相似了"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"00572c0f-8b7b-43d0-bcaa-b19a35ba2a94","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"904ee7bb-dff6-4108-a029-7d36742e0376","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"let promise = new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\n  fetch(\"/id/2\").then((name) => {\n    resolve(name);\n  });\n})\n  .then((name) => {\n    return new Promise((resolve) => {\n      fetch(`/name/${name}`).then((score) => {\n        resolve(score);\n      });\n    });\n  })\n  .then((score) => {\n    console.log(score);\n  });","collabId":"1f4287d5-7add-4a40-b93e-b282b7673ce4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"a0d5e298-4c18-4c30-91e9-014b5cb11d76","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"可以进一步将 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 与生成器结合起来，使得代码的写法看起来更加的像同步的写法，下面是想达到的效果"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"09181a6d-136c-42c1-aec4-bf3fb6cb655b","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"adc3f861-e261-4974-ab06-051c69239b59","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"asyncTaskRunner(*() => {\n  const name = yield fetch(\"id/2\");\n  const score = yield fetch(`/name/${name}`);\n  console.log(score);\n})","collabId":"938f5c5a-1237-4be2-b222-01df8ccbe95d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"63139e05-74e0-47a9-825f-e9333bdbbf38","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"asyncTaskRunner"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的实现如下"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"d88b6b2e-805b-468c-9ebc-7be7736b7dc4","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c98cd58a-c881-431a-bd05-0d71d9c763ec","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"function asyncTaskRunner(generator) {\n  const iterator = generator();\n\n  function handle(result) {\n    if (result.done) return;\n\n    const resultValue = result.value;\n\n    if (resultValue instanceof Promise) {\n      resultValue\n        .then((data) => {\n          handle(iterator.next(data));\n        })\n        .catch((err) => {\n          iterator.throw(err);\n        });\n    } else {\n      handle(iterator.next(resultValue));\n    }\n  }\n\n  try {\n    handle(iterator.next());\n  } catch (err) {\n    iterator.throw(err);\n  }\n}","collabId":"a9b69ae5-342d-42a0-a821-8f55c8b8e23d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9a730fd2-f038-4c7e-9020-73126fa9377f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 ES7 中提出了 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"async ... await"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 语法，它可以以同步的方式写出异步代码"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"js","uuid":"8dc2dc24-8991-4743-8fda-d3b1e1b75bf8","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"0b4df4f0-852e-4b70-a673-9c57ef4dbf3d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"(async () => {\n  const name = await fetch(\"/id/2\");\n  const score = await fetch(`/name/${name}`);\n  console.log(score);\n})();","collabId":"bfe38a82-e93a-438e-b44c-3ee853c1ac07","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Promise"],"createTime":1692198740889,"updateTime":1744174280439,"linkedCards":[{"id":285,"target":{"key":"card:285","type":"card","id":285},"summary":"JavaScript 是单线程的，为了不阻塞线程，很多方法都是异步的，通过回调函数的形式来处理函数结果，这就会带来一个问题，当回调特别多时，代码的可读性急剧下降 getUser(function(user) { getOrders(user...","tags":["JavaScript/Promise"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744174280439}}